{"seq":13,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/si-04-hartford-timeline/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T00:50:16.541Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"089ff4433dae5882b84ed251561723f0e6f92e8a6f47d4d4e70ad6ded7b0d7c3","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"Nadia, from the channel history: Gideon posted at 11:08 AM on 3 Aug that both lanes were working \"as of Aug 3, 11:07\", so 11:07 is the time he called it. The first check-in once kiosk 1 came back was trailer 8836. Mateo posted that at 11:03 AM: \"Kiosk 1 is back. Guard checked in trailer 8836; dispatch sees it.\" The channel doesn't give a time zone for those timestamps.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000125"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000126","thread_ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
